{
  "title": { "zh": "晨星就是昏星" },
  "tray": "proof",
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "古人以为清晨和黄昏天边的亮星是两颗，后来才知道都是金星。两个名字指同一样东西，写作 <b>=</b>：<wiki-ref to=\"equality\"></wiki-ref>。"
      }
    },
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "<level-ref to=\"decl-eq\"></level-ref>声明的相等带来两块元件：<part-ref to=\"part:rewrite\"></part-ref>接进 s = t 和一句提到 s 的话，在元件上把每个 s 框出来，点选的几处换成 t；<part-ref to=\"part:refl\"></part-ref>直接给出 t = t。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "q-eq",
      "words": ["everyday", "stars"],
      "kind": "proof",
      "consts": ["a", "b"],
      "tests": [{ "premises": { "p": "a = b", "q": "P(a)", "t": "∀x. P(x) → Q(x)" }, "goal": "Q(b)" }],
      "cases": [{ "P": "Bright", "Q": "Seen" }, { "P": "Seen", "Q": "Bright" }],
      "hint": [
        {
          "zh": "接好两根线，元件上会把每个「晨星」框出来：点一下框，那一处就换成「昏星」。"
        }
      ],
      "solution": ["r = rewrite[at=[0]](p, q)", "e = allE[t=b](t)", "m = mp(e, r)", "goal <- m"]
    }
  ]
}
